     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"line-break:after-white-space\">\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">Hi </span>D-RUG<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">gies! </span><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div>We&#39;ll be meeting from 10-noon virtually this week (link below). This is a group working session so come with your questions for our expeRts, or just bring your laptop and get in some distraction free R-coding time. We will be resuming in-person meetings\r\n in the Datalab classroom when the fall quarter starts in a few weeks!</div>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\">Zoom at this link: <a href=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09\" title=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(0,134,240)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd%3DS0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464561294000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2aCw34lFN9nigqQLtP4Q2-\">https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/96397082218?pwd=S0JXcW5hcUFkbTcwMHFQV1NVNkg3Zz09</a><br>\r\n</font>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\"><br>\r\n</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\".AppleSystemUIFont\">Please consider posting your questions to our </font>\r\n<div style=\"display:block\">\r\n<div style=\"display:inline-block\" role=\"link\">\r\n<a style=\"border-radius:10px;font-family:-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;display:block;width:228px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"button\" width=\"228\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.discourse.group/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464561294000&amp;usg=AOvVaw38NLRePc_TW-1SL66LL2c1\">\r\n<table style=\"table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;width:228px;background-color:#e5e6e9;font-family:-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"228\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"center\"><img style=\"width:228px;min-height:228px\" width=\"228\" height=\"228\" alt=\"9a136a95fbb5e134441536db1a42f033ccbc5fa9.png\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/attach/8e69b7b1245a3/9a136a95fbb5e134441536db1a42f033ccbc5fa9.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<table bgcolor=\"#E5E6E9\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"228\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;table-layout:fixed;background-color:rgba(229,230,233,1)\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:8px 0px 8px 0px\">\r\n<div style=\"max-width:100%;margin:0px 16px 0px 16px;overflow:hidden\">\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;font-weight:500;font-size:12px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;text-align:left\">\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.discourse.group/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464561294000&amp;usg=AOvVaw38NLRePc_TW-1SL66LL2c1\"><font color=\"#272727\" style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.847059)\">Davis R Users Group - Supportive R for science and research at UC Davis</font></a></div>\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;font-weight:400;font-size:11px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;text-align:left\">\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://d-rug.discourse.group/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://d-rug.discourse.group/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792464561294000&amp;usg=AOvVaw38NLRePc_TW-1SL66LL2c1\"><font color=\"#808080\" style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,0.498039)\">d-rug.discourse.group</font